# A target that is gone when the ability resolves (CR 608.2b): Bot1 bolts Bot2 and casts Stingcaster Mage; in response to
# its trigger, which targets the Bolt in the graveyard, Bot2 taps a Ghost Vacuum to exile the Bolt. The trigger is
# countered on resolution for having no legal target, so nothing gains flashback, and the Bolt stays in exile (Bot2 on
# 17, the Bolt not cast again).

